{"title":"1974 AHSME Problems/Problem 22","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1974_AHSME_Problems/Problem_22&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The minimum of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/c/0/ec08e1a154334e024d798a813784f5ad13ebaa67.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sin\\frac{A}{2}-\\sqrt{3}\\cos\\frac{A}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"136\" height=\"38\" /> is attained when <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/9/019e9892786e493964e145e7c5cf7b700314e53b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" /> is \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/2/0/620b597b5b7b3b13cf4af3e8c45e4e2179abd22f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{(A)\\ } -180^\\circ \\qquad \\mathrm{(B) \\ }60^\\circ \\qquad \\mathrm{(C) \\  } 120^\\circ \\qquad \\mathrm{(D) \\  } 0^\\circ \\qquad \\mathrm{(E) \\  }\\text{none of these}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"527\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1974_AHSME_Problems/Problem_22&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Define a new number <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/5/ff5fb3d775862e2123b007eb4373ff6cc1a34d4e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" /> such that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/5/c/85cd52878067ac3ba0a622e1cab8ecc805245f4e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\cos(B)=\\frac{1}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"89\" height=\"37\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/3/e/d3e35f24906563761c0502609af7da698fb37b70.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sin(B)=-\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"116\" height=\"41\" />. Notice that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/9/d/a9d90adf8cc3157cd01cb72d156c2d2909af448f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B=\\frac{5\\pi}{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"65\" height=\"38\" />. Therefore, we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/1/5/c15d4736f2f2f034948949a24b2c2659d08f9f0d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sin\\frac{A}{2}-\\sqrt{3}\\cos\\frac{A}{2}= 2\\cos(B)\\sin\\left(\\frac{A}{2}\\right)+2\\sin(B)\\cos\\left(\\frac{A}{2}\\right)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"455\" height=\"43\" />. \n</p><p>Recognizing the angle sum formula, we can rewrite this as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/1/8/3189ef517d9934ff50e0ac4c37a25b6eb5c756b3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sin\\frac{A}{2}-\\sqrt{3}\\cos\\frac{A}{2}=2\\sin\\left(\\frac{A}{2}+B\\right)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"276\" height=\"43\" />. We can now clearly see that the minimum is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/2/a/62a76677add1d246708c86edfc7c4b8a40184914.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"25\" height=\"15\" />, and this is achieved when <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/0/8/908eeb9a3806face76f430da1f66abe8b8b332c7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{A}{2}+B=\\frac{3\\pi}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"101\" height=\"38\" />. Plugging in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/9/d/a9d90adf8cc3157cd01cb72d156c2d2909af448f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B=\\frac{5\\pi}{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"65\" height=\"38\" />, we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/9/5/29510980695299e9a972a7c47396972975982664.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{A}{2}=-\\frac{\\pi}{6}\\implies A=-\\frac{\\pi}{3}=-60^\\circ$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"250\" height=\"38\" />. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/1/3/d1302e73ece29d10218238af739577904f6f00a3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\text{E}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1974_AHSME_Problems/Problem_22&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1974_AHSME\" title=\"1974 AHSME\">1974 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1974_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1974 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1974_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1974 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1974\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1974_AHSME_Problems/Problem_21\" title=\"1974 AHSME Problems/Problem 21\">Problem 21</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1974_AHSME_Problems/Problem_23\" title=\"1974 AHSME Problems/Problem 23\">Problem 23</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1974_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1974 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1974_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1974 AHSME 